# Raylee's Tweaks

Do not add controls to Settings.

The sidebar item directly under Settings is Raylee's Tweaks (`RayleesTweaksTab`, `resources/xml/tabs/raylees_tweaks.xml`). New options, selectors, and switches go on that page and save through `Settings::instance()`.

Settings stays the upstream page. A control that already lives there stays there unless the user asks to move it.
